// REQUIRES: long
// REQUIRES: go
// P03.22 (TYP-25, TYP-26): in a .go file struct embedding is Go's. Every
// program of Inputs/go-embedding (valid and invalid embedding: promotion,
// embedded pointers, shadowing by depth, ambiguous selectors, pointer
// receivers, duplicates, what cannot be embedded, recursion, generic and
// alias embedding, `extends` and `base` as names) gives the same outcome
// under `gopp check --go` as under `go build`, with errors on the same
// lines. Long: `go build` needs a warm build cache to stay fast.
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/go-embedding-diff.py %gopp %S/Inputs/go-embedding
